{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>通訊錄愈積愈亂，重複與錯漏的聯絡人往往難以人手清理。Cadre Contacts 專為整理 Apple 裝置內置聯絡人而設，適合多年來累積大量資料、又不願把資料交到雲端的使用者。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>本機檢測聯絡人健康度</h2>\n<p>Cadre Contacts 直接讀取 iPhone 內置的聯絡人資料，全程在裝置本機處理，不會上傳伺服器，亦無須註冊帳戶。它會為整本通訊錄評分，找出重複、缺漏與格式不一致的項目，並逐一提出修正建議，由使用者決定採用或略過。經常從多個帳戶匯入聯絡人，或累積多年重複資料的使用者，可藉此重新整理通訊錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1080x2340bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Cadre Contacts</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T00:38:09.167037+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}